#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_settings.html.twig
msgid "If enabled, invoices can be accessed by anyone who knows the invoice hash. The hash is a 30-60 character random hex string and is unfeasible to brute-force, but the link exposes the buyer's name, email, full address, phone, country and company/VAT. Use the lifetime setting below to automatically expire links."
msgstr "Ak je zapnuté, faktúry môže otvoriť ktokoľvek, kto pozná hash faktúry. Hash je náhodný hexadecimálny reťazec s 30 – 60 znakmi a nedá sa prakticky uhádnuť hrubou silou, ale odkaz odhaľuje meno, e-mail, úplnú adresu, telefón, krajinu a spoločnosť/IČ DPH kupujúceho. Nastavením platnosti nižšie môžete nechať odkazy automaticky vypršať."

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_settings.html.twig
msgid "If enabled, the selected canned response will be added to the default reply message."
msgstr "Ak je zapnuté, zvolená pripravená odpoveď sa pridá k predvolenej odpovedi."

#: src/modules/Order/templates/email/mod_order_hold_approved.html.twig
msgid "If it has an invoice to pay, you will receive it by email and find it in your client area. Setup starts as usual."
